Dear Students,

Here's a copy of teaching materials for students in Bands A, Bands B and C.
https://drive.google.com/file/d/1SC8scdLt0yqWWevrf7DiiO1rIU7hoeez/view?usp=
=3Dsharing

Band A (A1/A2/A3) is meant for primary school students.
Band B is for both primary and secondary level (that's why there are 2 fold=
ers for Band B)
Band C is for secondary level students.

In the same folder (and attached to this email), there's our teaching scope=
 and sequence, which is the flow of our phonics lessons, as well as a curri=
culum matrix which will show you the focus of each component across the dif=
ferent band levels.

Additionally, we have two sandboxed custom chatgpts. feel free to use these=
 GPTs if you have any questions or just want to try out creating lessons or=
 generating reports.
